 "script": "Showing day! Homie's selling the house. One tiny problem.\n\nEasy fix. Hang the family photo right over the hole!\n\nThe buyer walks in. The photo slips. Right onto his foot.\n\nOw! And now he sees the hole.\n\nAbout three in ten existing home sales are all cash, says the National Association of Realtors.\n\nOne. Get a repair estimate or an inspection, so you know the real number.\n\nTwo. Compare what you actually keep: an as-is cash offer, or listing after repairs, commissions and months of payments.\n\nThree. Disclose known problems the way your state requires.\n\nIf Homie can sell it, so can you.",
